 142:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q15.c ****   /* The function is internally
 143:Drivers/CMSIS/DSP/Source/FilteringFunctions/arm_correlate_fast_q15.c ****    * divided into three parts according to the number of multiplications that has to be
